{
  "title": "Aamal of the last ten Nights of Ramadhan",
  "data": "اَعُوْذُ بِجَلَالِ وَجْهِكَ الْكَرِيْمِ اَنْ يَّنْقَضِيَ عَنِّيْ شَهْرُ رَمَضَانَ اَوْ يَطْلُعَ الْفَجْرُ مِنْ لَّيْلَتِيْ هٰذِهٖ وَ لَكَ قِبَلِيْ تَبِعَةٌ اَوْ ذَنْبٌ تُعَذِّبُنِيْ عَلَيْهِ\nA'OODHU BI-JALAALI WAJHIKAL KAREEMI AY YANQADIYA A'NNEE SHAHRU RAMADAANA AW YATLU'AL FAJRU MIL LAYLATEE HAADHIHEE WA LAKA QIBALEE TABI'ATUN AW DHAMBUN TU'ADHDHIBUNEE A'LAYH\nI seek refuge in the majesty of Your noble Face lest the month of Ramadan passes away from me, or dawn breaks upon this night of mine, while there still remains a consequence or sin for which You may punish me.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اَدِّ عَنَّا حَقَّ مَا مَضٰى مِنْ شَهْرِ رَمَضَانَ وَ اغْفِرْ لَنَا تَقْصِيْرَنَا فِيْهِ\nALLAAHUMMA ADDI A'NNAA HAQQA MAA MADAA MIN SHAHRI RAMADAANA WAGHFIR LANAA TAQSEERANAA FEEH\nO Allah, fulfill on our behalf the duty of whatever has passed of the month of Ramadan, and forgive our shortcomings therein,\nوَ تَسَلَّمْهُ مِنَّا مَقْبُوْلًا وَّ لَا تُؤَاخِذْنَا بِاِسْرَافِنَا عَلٰٓى اَنْفُسِنَا وَ اجْعَلْنَا مِنَ الْمَرْحُوْمِيْنَ وَ لَا تَجْعَلْنَا مِنَ الْمَحْرُوْمِيْنَ\nWA TASALLAMHU MINNAA MAQBOOLAW WA LAA TU'AAKHIDHNAA BI-ISRAAFINAA A'LAA ANFUSINAA WAJ-A'LNAA MINAL MARHOOMEENA WA LAA TAJ'ALNAA MINAL MAHROOMEEN\nand receive it from us accepted, and do not hold against us our extravagance against ourselves, and make us among those shown mercy, and do not make us among the deprived.",
  "merits": "In al-Kafi, Shaykh al-Kulayni reports Imam Ja'far al-Sadiq (a.s.) as instructing this supplication for each of the last ten nights of Ramadan:"
}
